<title>HONG KONG: HK April merchandise trade figures.</title>
<headline>HK April merchandise trade figures.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Census and Statistics Department released the following figures for merchandise trade (rounded figures in billions of H.K. dollars and year-on-year percentage change) (*** denotes less than 0.05 percent)</p>
<p>					 April 1997	 March 1997</p>
<p>Re-exports to the five main destinations</p>
<p> China				 39.78 (+ 7.1)    33.51 (- 0.1)</p>
<p> U.S.				  20.28 (+ 9.2)    17.27 (+31.3)</p>
<p> Japan				  6.54 (+ 1.0)     6.63 (+ 5.4)</p>
<p> Germany				3.72 (- 4.2)     3.12 (+10.9)</p>
<p> U.K.				   2.83 (+ 8.4)     2.42 (+31.1)</p>
<p>					  April 1997	March 1997</p>
<p>Imports from the five main suppliers</p>
<p> China				 49.43 (+ 7.0)    44.74 (+19.8)</p>
<p> Japan				 20.11 (+ 5.6)    17.92 (- 4.8)</p>
<p> U.S.				  10.94 (+ 4.3)    10.21 (+ 3.6)</p>
<p> Taiwan				10.59 (- 5.6)    10.14 (- 2.0)</p>
<p> Singapore			    7.57 (+ 2.2)     6.55 (-13.0)</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441.  http://www.hk97.com  </p>
<p>					  April 1997	March 1997</p>
<p>Domestic exports to the five main destinations</p>
<p> China				  5.40 (- 4.0)    4.44 (- 3.0)</p>
<p> U.S.				   3.77 (- 5.4)    3.44 (+22.7)</p>
<p> Japan				  0.91 (- 9.2)    0.98 (- 4.8)</p>
<p> Germany				0.73 (- 3.9)    0.62 (+16.1)</p>
<p> U.K.				   0.74 (+ 3.3)    0.65 (+ 9.4)</p>
</text>
